VEYSTRIX

This repository does not include model weights.

Veystrix is the current name of the project previously published as MACQWEN
(and, for the first runtime, FlashNext). The earlier name remains in historical
documents, commit history, measurement records and a few internal module paths
(`macqwen/`) that are kept for compatibility with existing scripts, caches and
harness clients.

