legal/LICENSE_PROVENANCE.md records what is known about authorship and what is open.

Model checkpoints
-----------------
The research checkpoint used in measurements is distributed by its publisher.
Other checkpoints (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next variants, Qwen3.8-27B, K2-Horizon-7B,
Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B) are also distributed separately by their publishers.
K2-Horizon-7B-MLX-8bit is published by abenzerps and includes a checkpoint-supplied
MLX model implementation. Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-mlx-2bit is published by prism-ml
under Apache-2.0 and includes a checkpoint-supplied runtime loader. Review each
checkpoint's license before download, use, modification or redistribution. Veystrix
does not bundle or redistribute any of them.

Dependencies
------------
MLX, MLX-LM, MLX-VLM, Transformers, NumPy, Requests, Hugging Face Hub, Sparkle and
other dependencies are separate projects under their own licenses; see
legal/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and legal/dependency-licenses.md.

Veystrix includes local compatibility and runtime patches. These patches do not
change the licenses of upstream projects or model checkpoints.
